@startuml SOP-AI-001-AI-Project-Generator
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #333333
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F0F0F0
    ParticipantBorderColor #333333
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E6F3FF
}

actor "PM" as PM
participant "Frontend UI" as UI
participant "Backend API" as API
participant "AI Engine\n(OpenAI/Gemini)" as AI
participant "CPM Engine" as CPM
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

PM -> UI: Nhập Prompt\n(VD: Tạo dự án website...)
activate UI
UI -> PM: Hiển thị Prompt editor (chỉnh sửa nếu cần)
PM -> UI: Submit yêu cầu
UI -> API: POST /api/projects/:id/ai/generate
activate API

API -> AI: Gửi Prompt
activate AI
AI --> API: Trả về JSON structure\n(Phases, Sprints, Epics, Tasks, Dependencies, Milestones)
deactivate AI

API -> API: Validate & Parse JSON Schema
API -> DB: INSERT Phases, Sprints, Epics
API -> DB: INSERT Tasks, Dependencies, Milestones

API -> CPM: recalculateCPM(projectId)
activate CPM
CPM -> DB: Fetch Dependencies
CPM -> CPM: Topological Sort, Forward Pass, Backward Pass
CPM -> DB: UPDATE Task (es, ef, ls, lf, float, is_critical)
CPM --> API: Done
deactivate CPM

API --> UI: Trả về Project Plan Data
deactivate API

UI -> UI: Render Gantt Chart
UI --> PM: Hiển thị kế hoạch trên Gantt
deactivate UI

@enduml
